### 六年级英语

#### 人教版PEP

- Unit 1: How can I get there?
  - 交通和地点：science museum, post office, bookstore, cinema, hospital, crossing, turn left, turn right, go straight
  - 句型：Where is the...? / How can I get to...?
- Unit 2: Ways to go to school
  - 交通方式：on foot, by bus, by plane, by taxi, by ship, by subway, by train, by bike
  - 句型：How do you come to school? / How can I get there?
- Unit 3: My weekend plan
  - 周末活动：visit grandparents, see a film, take a trip, go to the supermarket, this morning/afternoon/evening, tonight, tomorrow, next week
  - 句型：What are you going to do? / Where/When are you going?
- Unit 4: I have a pen pal
  - 爱好：likes reading, singing, dancing, playing football, doing kung fu, cooking Chinese food, studying Chinese, does word puzzles, goes hiking
  - 句型：What are your hobbies? / Does he/she live in...?
- Unit 5: What does he do?
  - 职业：factory worker, postman, businessman, police officer, fisherman, scientist, pilot, coach
  - 句型：What does he/she do? / Where does he/she work?
- Unit 6: How do you feel?
  - 情感：angry, afraid, sad, worried, happy, ill, see a doctor, take a deep breath, count to ten, do more exercise, wear warm clothes
  - 句型：How do you feel? / What's wrong? / He/She should...

